+///
+/// The semantic identity of a hyperlink: what makes two cells part of the
+/// same link, as opposed to the page-local index of the hyperlink set.
+/// An explicit identity is the OSC 8 `id=` bytes, which the functions
+/// return through a buffer. An implicit identity is the token in this
+/// struct.
